{"text": "Slide 1\nFleet Incident Review - Q2 2026\nQuarry Road Beverage Distributors, Inc.\nSafety Committee, July 14, 2026. Prepared by Consuelo Arrieta, Fleet & Risk Manager\nCONFIDENTIAL - contains personnel and claim information. Do Not forward outside the committee.\nSpeaker notes: Speaker notes: remind everyone this deck is not to be saved to personal drives. Loss Run from Hawthorne Commercial Indemnity Co. is as of 6/30/26.\n\nSlide 2\nSummary\nThree incidents this quarter (Q1: 5). Two preventable.\nTotal incurred to date $41,930; our deductible is $2,500 per claim on policy HCI-CA-7730418.\nNo DOT-recordable crashes. One OSHA 300 log entry (shoulder).\nAll three units carry RoadLedger Telematics gateways and dash Cameras.\n\nSlide 3\nIncidents\nUnit\tDate\tDriver\tVehicle / Plate\tType\tClaim\tEst. Cost\n112\t4/9/26\tL. Kahale\tFreightliner M2 / AZ AB4 7TK2\tBacking, dock at Chandler DC\tHCI-26-0041877\t$6,180\n117\t5/21/26\tV. Malinowski\tRam ProMaster / AZ CKR9041\tRear-end, I-10 at Baseline Rd\tHCI-26-0058102\t$31,400\n204\t6/12/26\tR. Okonedo\tIsuzu NPR / AZ BXT 5520\tSideswipe, parked car, Tempe\tHCI-26-0066390\t$4,350\n\nSlide 4\nUnit 112 - Backing (preventable)\nDriver: Leilani Kahale, CDL Class B, AZ Lic. D08841297, hired Feb 2022\nVIN 1FVACWFC5NHNK4418; Telematics Device RL-GW-00A4F17C\nStruck a bollard while backing without a spotter. No Injuries.\nRepair at Ocotillo Collision & Frame, invoice OCF-11827, $6,180.00 paid 5/4\nPost-incident Tests at Camelback Occupational Health: Negative\nSpeaker notes: Notes: Leilani self-reported within 10 minutes. First incident in 4 years. Coaching only.\n\nSlide 5\nUnit 117 - Rear-end (preventable)\nDriver: Viktor Malinowski, employee no. E-3381, AZ Lic. D05570126\nVIN 3C6LRVDG7PE562290; gateway RL-GW-00A51B03; camera serial DC4-7719-KQ\nTelematics: 52 mph in a 38 mph work zone; Hard Braking 0.9 seconds before impact; phone handling flagged by camera\nOther party: 2 occupants, soft-tissue claims; Hawthorne adjuster Barrett Yancey, 602-555-0137, reserve $25,000 bodily Injury\nDriver's own Injury: right shoulder strain, 9 days restricted duty (workers' comp claim WC-AZ-26-118845)\nPost-incident Testing under 49 CFR § 382.303 not required (no CDL vehicle); company policy test done anyway. Result: non-negative for THC, confirmed by MRO\nSpeaker notes: Speaker notes: Viktor told HR he holds a state medical marijuana card for PTSD from his Army service. This is NOT for discussion in committee beyond \"policy violation under review.\" Dale Fitzhugh (HR) owns it. His MVR also shows a 2023 citation for texting while driving.\n\nSlide 6\nUnit 204 - Sideswipe (non-preventable)\nDriver: Ruth Okonedo, AZ Lic. D11206483\nVIN JALC4W167P7K01156; gateway RL-GW-00A4D9E0\nParked car door opened into the lane on Mill Avenue. Camera clears our driver.\nOther vehicle: AZ plate HJL2R7, owner's insurer has accepted liability. Subrogation Open, $4,350.00 expected back.\nPost-incident Tests: Negative\nSpeaker notes: Notes: Ruth is the shop steward for the drivers' local; she asked that the camera clip not be used in training without her OK.\n\nSlide 7\nActions\nAction\tOwner\tDue\nSpotter rule retraining, all Class B drivers\tC. Arrieta\tAug 1\nDecision on Unit 117 driver\tD. Fitzhugh\t7/24\nUpdate Form MCS-150 mileage (FMCSA)\tArrieta\tAugust 31, 2026\nAsk Hawthorne about camera credit at renewal (10/1/2026)\tYancey / Arrieta\tNext meeting\nSpeaker notes: Notes: questions to carrieta@quarryroadbev.example or ext. 4417. Portal for clips: https://fleet.roadledger.example/qrbd/incidents, shared login qrbd_safety.", "kind": "PowerPoint presentation", "detail": "7 slides · 521 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Consuelo Arrieta", "Leilani Kahale", "V. Malinowski", "R. Okonedo", "Viktor Malinowski", "Ruth Okonedo", "Barrett Yancey", "Dale Fitzhugh", "C. Arrieta"], "companies": ["Quarry Road Beverage Distributors, Inc.", "Hawthorne Commercial Indemnity Co.", "RoadLedger", "Camelback Occupational Health", "Ocotillo Collision & Frame", "Hawthorne", "Quarry Road Beverage"]}, "topics": {"places": ["Chandler DC", "Tempe", "Hawthorne", "Mill Avenue"], "health": ["right shoulder strain", "restricted duty", "PTSD"], "sensitive": ["Race or ethnicity", "Disability", "race or ethnicity", "religion", "political views or donations", "union membership", "sexual orientation", "immigration or citizenship status"], "names": ["Consuelo", "Leilani", "V. Malinowski", "R. Okonedo", "Viktor", "Ruth", "Dale", "C. Arrieta", "Yancey"]}, "judged": {"candidates": 0, "requests": 0, "failures": 0, "places": [], "labels": {}}, "chunks": 2, "chunkErrors": 0, "topicErrors": 0, "importMs": 3.300000000745058, "modelMs": 0, "topicMs": 0, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "card_partial", "phone", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "street", "zip", "postal_ca", "places", "region", "names", "sensitive_topics"], "detections": [{"start": 14, "end": 29, "text": "Incident Review", "kind": "person", "source": "short-form", "canonical": "Incident Review"}, {"start": 32, "end": 39, "text": "Q2 2026", "kind": "record", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "Q2 2026"}, {"start": 40, "end": 79, "text": "Quarry Road Beverage Distributors, Inc.", "kind": "company", "source": "model", "canonical": "Quarry Road Beverage Distributors, Inc."}, {"start": 80, "end": 96, "text": "Safety Committee", "kind": "company", "source": "short-form", "canonical": "Safety Committee"}, {"start": 98, "end": 111, "text": "July 14, 2026", "kind": "date", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "July 14, 2026"}, {"start": 125, "end": 133, "text": "Consuelo", "kind": "person", "source": "short-form", "canonical": "Consuelo Arrieta"}, {"start": 134, "end": 163, "text": "Arrieta, Fleet & Risk Manager", "kind": "company", "source": "short-form", "canonical": "Arrieta, Fleet & Risk Manager"}, {"star